  "prefLabel": "Inst 403.01 Continuing Education at Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 403.01 Continuing Education at Renewal. An individual wishing to renew their manufactured home installation license shall complete a continuing education program as described in Inst 402.01(b) approved by the board at least once every 4 years.\n\nSource. #8494, eff 12-24-05; ss by #10115, eff 4-14-12; EXPIRED: 4-14-22\n\nNew. #14426, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36 (formerly Inst 304.01)",
